    "created_at": "2016-02-23T17:32:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-23T17:32:18Z",
    "body": "At that point we'd have to change the normative requirements too. The normative requirement is: \"In the case of input elements, if the control has no text field, then the method must do nothing.\" Your last suggested note overreaches a bit.\n",
