    "created_at": "2016-02-23T17:49:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-23T17:49:50Z",
    "body": "I see. I think the confusion comes from how the input data is visually represented. Although clicking a date field brings up a date picker, the chosen date is represented as text. That makes the \"if the control has no text field\" a little nebulous.\n",
